{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>חנכו.</b> Like חנכת המזבח (dedication of the altar), and likewise חנוך לנער (Proverbs 22:6). From this our Rabbis, of blessed memory, derived: one trains the boys. The reason: for his heart and all his desire is to dedicate his house, and so his heart is to his house, not to battle; therefore he will flee and cause others to flee."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:24:01.697086110Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}